<title>USA: Alphanet files for public offering.</title>
<headline>Alphanet files for public offering.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR KNOLLS, N.J. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlphaNet Solutions Inc said Thursday that it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 2,000,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>AlphaNet said 1,150,000 of the shares are to be issued and sold by the company and 850,0OO are to be sold by certain shareholders.</p>
<p>The offering is being made through Montgomery Securities, Cruttenden Roth Inc and Parker/Hunter Inc the company said.</p>
